sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Patient
  participant Mouth as Text or Voice mouth
  participant Ex as sessions.exchange
  participant Ext as extractTurn (OpenAI #1)
  participant Log as logistics-llm (OpenAI #1b)
  participant Led as ledger.applyOperations
  participant Parsers as preference / escort / shipping
  participant Dec as decide
  participant Sched as scheduler (ACT only)
  participant Comp as composeReply (OpenAI #2)

  Patient->>Mouth: utterance
  Mouth->>Ex: POST /api/session/:id/message {content}

  par concurrent
    Ex->>Ext: factsOnFile + precedingAgentTurn + patientTurn
    Ext-->>Ex: operations + signals
  and
    Note over Log: only if a logistics gate is waiting
    Ex->>Log: classifySoonest / Decline / ClosingIntent
    Log-->>Ex: soonestOk | declined | intent | null
  end

  Ex->>Led: operations
  Led-->>Ex: ClinicalFact[] + this-turn signals
  Ex->>Parsers: raw text + LLM judgment or regex fallback
  Parsers-->>Ex: schedulingPreference / escortContact / shippingAddress
  Ex->>Dec: DecisionInput from session state
  Dec-->>Ex: ACT | ASK | STOP | HANDOFF + authored say

  alt outcome is ACT
    Ex->>Sched: scheduleScreening + invites
    Sched-->>Ex: booked or waitlisted + confirmation copy
  end

  alt not ACT, and not a neutral non-repeat
    Ex->>Comp: decision.say + signals
    Comp-->>Ex: acknowledgment prepended, substance untouched
  end

  Ex-->>Mouth: reply.text + facts + decision + resolution
  Mouth-->>Patient: Daphne's line
